{%- doc -%}
  Banner under the buy box on the v3 product page (2026-10). One banner for
  every product on the template (owner's choice), set in Theme settings ->
  "APGO — Product page banner"; no image, no banner.

  Rendered at the end of .apgo-cc-pdp__buy-col (sections/apgo_product_page_v3.liquid):
  on desktop that is inside the right-hand buy card, under Add to cart / Buy
  now (outside the card the grid would push it below the taller gallery);
  on phones the inline buttons are hidden, so it sits under the delivery
  line, above Description.
{%- enddoc -%}
{%- assign apgo_pdp_banner = settings.apgo_pdp_banner_image -%}
{%- if apgo_pdp_banner != blank -%}
  {%- assign apgo_pdp_banner_alt = settings.apgo_pdp_banner_alt | default: apgo_pdp_banner.alt -%}
  <div class="apgo-pdp-banner">
    {%- if settings.apgo_pdp_banner_link != blank -%}
      <a class="apgo-pdp-banner__link" href="{{ settings.apgo_pdp_banner_link }}">
    {%- endif -%}
    {{ apgo_pdp_banner
      | image_url: width: 1200
      | image_tag:
        class: 'apgo-pdp-banner__img',
        widths: '400, 600, 800, 1200',
        sizes: '(min-width: 1024px) 480px, calc(100vw - 32px)',
        loading: 'lazy',
        alt: apgo_pdp_banner_alt
    }}
    {%- if settings.apgo_pdp_banner_link != blank -%}
      </a>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
  <style>
    .apgo-pdp-banner { margin-top: 16px; }
    .apgo-pdp-banner__link { display: block; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; }
    .apgo-pdp-banner__img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 12px; }
    .apgo-pdp-banner__link:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #f08418; outline-offset: 3px; }
  </style>
{%- endif -%}
